# Deterministic local ViolaWWW Help menu smoke test.
#
# Uses XTest-style pointer motion and button events to click the Help
# menubar entry. This intentionally uses host screenshots rather than
# in-process snapshots: the Help menu is an override-redirect top-level
# popup, not part of vw's main window framebuffer.
delay 2500
wait-window "vw|Viola" 3000
screenshot initial
assert-image initial common-visible.json
motion 780 14
button 1 press
delay 2000
screenshot pressed
assert-image pressed common-visible.json
assert-image pressed violawww-help-menu.json
button 1 release
delay 1000
screenshot released
assert-image released common-visible.json
assert-image released violawww-help-menu.json
